\chapter{Deployment and Execution}

\section*{Backend}

The backend can be started using the following commands:

\begin{verbatim}
cd backend
npm install
npm run dev
\end{verbatim}

The backend requires environment variables such as:

\begin{verbatim}
MONGO\_URI=your\_mongodb\_connection\_string
JWT\_SECRET=your\_secret\_key
PORT=5000
\end{verbatim}

\section*{Frontend}

The frontend can be started using:

\begin{verbatim}
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
\end{verbatim}

The frontend communicates with the backend through the configured API URL.

